# Force LF everywhere, regardless of the checkout platform's git config
# (e.g. Git for Windows commonly defaults core.autocrlf=true). Several test
# fixtures encode exact byte content (line-removal fixes, token-count
# fixtures, JSONL parsing fixtures); a CRLF checkout on Windows CI silently
# broke fix mode's line-numbering by introducing stray \r characters the
# rest of the tool doesn't expect. See docs/notes.md (Phase 8) for the bug
# this caused.
* text=auto eol=lf
